    "methods_description": "Cortico-Cortical Evoked Potentials (CCEPs) were recorded using electrocorticography (ECoG) during single-pulse electrical stimulation (SPES) in awake patients (SPES-clinical) and under general propofol anesthesia (SPES-propofol). Electrode positions were estimated using Freesurfer on individual subject MRI scans and converted to MNI305 space using surface-based non-linear transformation.",
